28
00:01:22,010 --> 00:01:26,830
So Marco the first word that I want to talk about today is this verb to activate.

29
00:01:27,350 --> 00:01:27,750
That's right.

30
00:01:28,560 --> 00:01:36,290
We have a verb here to activate and this means to make something start to work, to make something begin.

31
