100
00:05:13,240 --> 00:05:14,200
Hidden fees.

101
00:05:14,700 --> 00:05:15,020
What are these?

102
00:05:15,120 --> 00:05:17,900
The operator guarantees that there are no hidden fees.

103
00:05:18,340 --> 00:05:24,100
So this is usually what we call the fine print, the small fees that we don't really know about.

104
00:05:24,280 --> 00:05:28,140
So they say, oh, it costs $3 a month, but you have small little hidden fees.

105
00:05:28,320 --> 00:05:35,600
Like if you're late on a payment, they'll charge you an extra dollar or if you use the service too much, they'll charge you another extra dollar.

106
00:05:35,600 --> 00:05:35,910
Right.

107
00:05:36,600 --> 00:05:41,850
So a fee is something that you pay, all right, and something that is hidden means you cannot see it.

108
00:05:42,440 --> 00:05:49,930
And so like you're saying with this example, there are many, many conditions, many, many different things, rules that we have to follow.

109
00:05:50,160 --> 00:05:57,130
