112
00:06:05,140 --> 00:06:09,140
Okay, so a surcharge is an extra amount of money that you have to pay.

113
00:06:10,400 --> 00:06:14,380
So we say that this service has no hidden fees or surcharges.

114
00:06:14,600 --> 00:06:19,360
So that means that we don't have to pay anything additional to what we are already paying.

115
00:06:19,920 --> 00:06:25,140
For example, some companies will say, okay, pay us $10 and you get your new cell phone phone plan.

116
00:06:26,000 --> 00:06:30,280
But to activate your service is another $5.

117
00:06:30,280 --> 00:06:33,140
So the total price is $15 and that's, that's a surcharge.

118
00:06:33,520 --> 00:06:35,640
It's an extra fee that you have to pay.

119
00:06:35,640 --> 00:06:35,880
That's right.

120
00:06:36,640 --> 00:06:37,640
Okay.

121
00:06:37,640 --> 00:06:44,440
